  "description": "<p class=\"p1\"><strong> Brand introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Say Less Wear More&trade; is a bold and artistic streetwear brand that celebrates <span class=\"s1\"><strong>silent self-expression</strong></span>. Inspired by the concept &ldquo;Say Less&hellip; And Please, Express Yourself&rdquo;, we create unique fashion pieces that allow people to communicate who they are &mdash; without saying a word. Every item tells a story, blending digital art, glitch aesthetics, and cultural commentary.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Our product range includes premium hoodies, expressive t-shirts, and accessories &mdash; all designed to stand out. Each design is rooted in the concept of <span class=\"s1\"><strong>The Broken Simulation</strong></span>, reflecting the blurry line between reality and the digital world. Made with premium materials, our on-demand products combine comfort, durability, and visual impact.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Limited drops &amp; exclusive designs</strong></span> inspired by digital art and cultural glitches.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Conceptual storytelling fashion</strong></span> for creative minds who want to express themselves visually.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><span class=\"s1\"><strong>High-quality production</strong></span>, with top-tier printing and sustainable, on-demand manufacturing.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Global appeal</strong></span>, with special focus on creative communities</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Affiliates earn <span class=\"s1\"><strong>competitive commissions</strong></span> on every sale generated through their links. Payments are processed monthly via PayPal or bank transfer. Top-performing affiliates can unlock higher commission rates and exclusive bonuses.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>Free marketing materials: banners, product mockups, affiliate-exclusive content.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>Dedicated affiliate support to help you craft campaigns and maximize earnings.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>Special seasonal campaigns &amp; discount codes to boost your conversion rates.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p4\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>Our products ship worldwide, giving you access to a global customer base.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">🚀 Join us today and help spread the message: <span class=\"s1\"><strong>Say Less&hellip; And Please, Express Yourself!</strong></span></p>",
